{"id":"1085c5946fe8e449","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-coverreduction.md","title":"Three reductions preserving all minimal covers","display":"thm-coverreduction — Three reductions preserving all minimal covers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-coverreduction","aliases":["27-thm-coverreduction"],"display":"thm-coverreduction — Three reductions preserving all minimal covers","depends_on":["[[27-df-covermatrix]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.3.2 Simplifications S1–S3","source_printed_pages":"147,148","source_pdf_pages":"171,172","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-coverreduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-coverreduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-coverreduction — Three reductions preserving all minimal covers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.2 Simplifications S1–S3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"147,148"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"171,172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C\">\\(R,C\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\">\\(A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\">\\(A|_{R&#39;\\times C&#39;}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a> 中保留行列载体的矩阵限制；各条约简中的行列索引在对应公式内量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r_0\\in R\\;\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\{i\\in C\\mid A(r_0,i)=1\\}=\\{j\\}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\{S\\cup\\{j\\}\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{\\{r\\in R:\\,A(r,j)=0\\}\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r_0\\in R\\;\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\{i\\in C\\mid A(r_0,i)=1\\}=\\{j\\}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\{S\\cup\\{j\\}\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{\\{r\\in R:\\,A(r,j)=0\\}\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r_0,r_1\\in R\\;\\left(\\left(r_0\\ne r_1\\land\\forall i\\in C\\;A(r_0,i)\\le A(r_1,i)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cov}(A)=\\mathrm{Cov}(A|_{(R\\setminus\\{r_1\\})\\times C})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r_0,r_1\\in R\\;\\left(\\left(r_0\\ne r_1\\land\\forall i\\in C\\;A(r_0,i)\\le A(r_1,i)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cov}(A)=\\mathrm{Cov}(A|_{(R\\setminus\\{r_1\\})\\times C})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall r\\in R\\;A(r,j)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{R\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall r\\in R\\;A(r,j)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{R\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>S1 的单一 1 行强制选 j，删去已覆盖行与该列后，剩余极小覆盖与原极小覆盖一一对应。S2 较小行的覆盖约束蕴涵较大行的约束，所以后者可删。S3 的零列对覆盖没有贡献，任何极小覆盖都不选它。三个公式刻画保留全部极小覆盖的精确变换，不把它们与只保证一个最优解存在的列支配规则混合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-covermatrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$；$\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$A|_{R'\\times C'}$ 是 [[27-df-covermatrix]] 中保留行列载体的矩阵限制；各条约简中的行列索引在对应公式内量化。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$；$\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$A|_{R'\\times C'}$ 是 [[27-df-covermatrix]] 中保留行列载体的矩阵限制；各条约简中的行列索引在对应公式内量化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R,C","display":false},{"tex":"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cov},\\mathrm{MinCov}","display":false},{"tex":"A|_{R'\\times C'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r_0\\in R\\;\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\{i\\in C\\mid A(r_0,i)=1\\}=\\{j\\}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\{S\\cup\\{j\\}\\mid S\\in\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{\\{r\\in R:\\,A(r,j)=0\\}\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r_0,r_1\\in R\\;\\left(\\left(r_0\\ne r_1\\land\\forall i\\in C\\;A(r_0,i)\\le A(r_1,i)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cov}(A)=\\mathrm{Cov}(A|_{(R\\setminus\\{r_1\\})\\times C})\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall j\\in C\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall r\\in R\\;A(r,j)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MinCov}(A)=\\mathrm{MinCov}(A|_{R\\times(C\\setminus\\{j\\})})\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2077,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-coverreduction|thm-coverreduction — Three reductions preserving all minimal covers]]"}],"outgoing":["1dd9f6247717bebe"]}